## 4. Investment Thesis & Peer Comparison
**Core Thesis:** TSLA is a long-term compounding engine with improving FCF and strong balance sheet, though valuation remains rich relative to peers like GM (EV/EBITDA ~10x vs. TSLA ~25x).  

